# Documentation

Canonical docs:

- `README.md` — index
- `AGENTS.md` — agent briefing
- `docs/` — architecture, API, deploy, operations, reddit, markdown, parked work
- `HANDOVER.md` / `MDSpec.md` — stubs that point at the above

When changing behaviour, update the matching `docs/*.md` in the same change (or the same checkpoint). Parked keep-awake detail belongs only in `docs/PARKED.md`.
